---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/RealestateLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Markham Real Estate | Neighbourhood Profile | Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent"
  description="Markham neighbourhood profile covering Unionville, Cornell, Berczy Village, and Cathedraltown. Housing types, price ranges, transit, schools, and market insights from Cory Wong."
  canonicalPath="/neighbourhoods/markham"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">Markham</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__subtitle">Neighbourhood Profile</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profile Content -->
  <article class="profile">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <div class="profile__intro">
        <p>
          Markham is one of the GTA's most sought-after communities, combining strong schools,
          distinct neighbourhood character, and a growing tech and business corridor along
          Highway 7. For families moving up from Toronto or first-time buyers seeking more
          space, Markham consistently ranks among the top choices in York Region.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Character and Feel -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Character and Feel</h2>
        <p>
          Markham is not one neighbourhood but several distinct communities, each with its own
          character. Unionville is the heritage heart &mdash; walkable, with a charming Main
          Street, independent shops, and a village atmosphere. Cornell and Berczy Village are
          newer master-planned communities with modern homes, parks, and well-designed
          streetscapes. Cathedraltown offers larger lots and estate-style homes. Markham
          Village provides a quieter, established residential feel.
        </p>
        <p>
          Markham has a large East Asian community that contributes to an exceptional food
          scene, cultural vibrancy, and strong community networks. The diversity is a defining
          feature of the area and a significant draw for many buyers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Who Buys -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Who Buys in Markham</h2>
        <p>
          Move-up buyers are the largest group &mdash; families outgrowing condos or smaller
          homes in Toronto who want strong schools, more space, and a suburban community feel
          without sacrificing accessibility. First-time buyers are active in the condo and
          townhome segments, particularly near Highway 7. Investors look at properties near
          York University's Markham campus, Seneca College, and the growing Highway 7 tech
          corridor.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Housing Types and Price Ranges -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Housing Types and Price Ranges</h2>
        <ul class="profile__price-list">
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Detached</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$1.1M &ndash; $2.5M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Semi-detached</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$900K &ndash; $1.3M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Freehold townhomes</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$750K &ndash; $1.1M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Condos (near Hwy 7)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">From $550K</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="profile__price-note">
          Unionville and Angus Glen carry a premium due to school catchments, heritage character,
          and proximity to amenities.
        </p>
        <p class="profile__price-disclaimer">
          These are general estimates based on market activity in early 2026. Actual prices
          vary by property. Speak with Cory for a current assessment.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Transit and Highways -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Transit and Highways</h2>
        <p>
          Markham has strong highway access via the 404 and DVP corridors for commuters heading
          into Toronto. Highway 407 provides an east-west toll route that connects to Brampton
          and Mississauga. The Stouffville GO line offers rail service into Union Station,
          with stations at Markham, Centennial, and Unionville. York Region Transit (YRT)
          provides local bus service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Amenities and Schools -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Amenities and Schools</h2>
        <p>
          Markham offers strong retail options including Pacific Mall and Markville Mall, along
          with a diverse restaurant scene that is among the best in the GTA. The area has
          extensive parks, community centres, and recreational facilities.
        </p>
        <p>
          Schools are a major draw. Unionville High School and Milliken Mills High School are
          consistently ranked among the top public high schools in Ontario. The strength of
          school catchments directly influences property values across Markham &mdash; homes
          within top-ranked school boundaries carry a measurable premium.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Real Estate Perspective -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Real Estate Perspective</h2>
        <p>
          Markham has held its value through the broader correction better than many GTA
          communities. Detached homes in desirable areas remain resilient, driven by
          consistent demand from families prioritizing schools and community. Active listings
          have increased, giving buyers more selection than they have had in recent years, but
          well-priced homes in top school catchments continue to move quickly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="profile__cta">
        <a href="/contact" class="cta cta--primary">Discuss Markham Real Estate with Cory</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Compliance -->
      <div class="profile__compliance">
        <p>
          Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent. Real estate services provided through Trustwell
          Realty Inc., Brokerage. Information is believed to be accurate but is not guaranteed.
          Speak with Cory for advice specific to your situation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- Newsletter -->
  <section class="newsletter">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="newsletter__heading">Stay Informed</h2>
      <p class="newsletter__text">
        Get monthly market data, neighbourhood insights, and practical advice for buyers
        and sellers across the Greater Toronto Area.
      </p>
      <form id="newsletter-form" class="newsletter__form" novalidate>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="newsletter-email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="you@example.com"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          class="newsletter__input"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="cta cta--primary newsletter__btn">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p id="newsletter-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  const newsletterForm = document.getElementById('newsletter-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const newsletterStatus = document.getElementById('newsletter-form-status');

  if (newsletterForm && newsletterStatus) {
    newsletterForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      newsletterStatus.textContent = '';
      newsletterStatus.className = 'form-status';

      const formData = new FormData(newsletterForm);
      const payload = {
        type: 'newsletter',
        email: formData.get('email'),
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/lead', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          newsletterStatus.textContent = 'You\'re subscribed! Watch your inbox for the next report.';
          newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--success');
          newsletterForm.reset();
        } else {
          throw new Error('Request failed');
        }
      } catch {
        newsletterStatus.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
        newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--error');
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .content-narrow {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .page-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Profile */
  .profile {
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .profile__intro {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__intro p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .profile__section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .profile__section-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__section p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Price List */
  .profile__price-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__price-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .profile__price-list li:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__price-label {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .profile__price-value {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: right;
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__price-note {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .profile__price-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .profile__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* Compliance */
  .profile__compliance {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__compliance p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .newsletter {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .newsletter__heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .newsletter__form {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .newsletter__input {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .newsletter__input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ffffff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .newsletter__btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .newsletter__btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .form-status {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    min-height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--success {
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--error {
    color: #fecaca;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .profile__price-list li {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }

    .profile__price-value {
      text-align: left;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .newsletter__form {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
